diance,\nsudden and frequent, like lightning.\nThen it breathed: \"The love with which I burn\ntoward the virtue that followed me\nto the palm and leaving of the field\nmoves me to speak to you, that you delight\nin her. Tell me what Hope promises you.\"\nAnd I: \"The old and new Scriptures\nset the target, and this reveals to me\nall the souls God has made his friends.\nIsaiah says each will be clothed\nwith double garments in his own land—\nand his own land is this delightful life.\nYour brother too, far more explicitly,\nwhere he writes of the white robes,\nreveals this truth to us.\"\nFirst, near the end of these words,","startTime":158.88,"endTime":242.16,"words":[{"word":"Like","start":158.961,"end":159.201},{"word":"a","start":159.201,"end":159.281},{"word":"student","start":159.281,"end":159.761},{"word":"following","start":159.761,"end":160.241},{"word":"his","start":160.241,"end":160.401},{"word":"teacher,","start":160.401,"end":161.281},{"word":"ready","start":161.281,"end":161.801},{"word":"and","start":161.801,"end":162.001},{"word":"eager","start":162.001,"end":162.361},{"word":"in","start":162.361,"end":162.481},{"word":"his","start":162.481,"end":162.721},{"word":"area","start":162.721,"end":163.041},{"word":"of","start":163.041,"end":163.201},{"word":"expertise","start":163.201,"end":163.921},{"word":"to","start":163.921,"end":164.001},{"word":"display","start":164.001,"end":164.521},{"word":"his","start":164.521,"end":164.841},{"word":"skill,","start":164.841,"end":165.441},{"word":"I","start":165.441,"end":165.521},{"word":"said:","start":165.521,"end":166.401},{"word":"\"Hope","start":166.401,"end":166.881},{"word":"is","start":166.881,"end":167.041},{"word":"the","start":167.041,"end":167.281},{"word":"assured","start":167.281,"end":167.921},{"word":"expectation","start":167.921,"end":168.561},{"word":"of","start":168.561,"end":168.881},{"word":"future","start":168.881,"end":169.121},{"word":"glory,","start":169.121,"end":170.041},{"word":"produ