th both garments—\nand this you shall carry back to your world.\"\nAt these words the flaming circle\nfell quiet, along with the sweet mingling\nof sounds made by the threefold breath,\njust as oars beating in the water\nall stop at a whistle's sound\nto escape danger or fatigue.\nHow disturbed I was in my mind\nwhen I turned to look at Beatrice\nand could not see her, though I stood\nclose beside her in the World of Joy!","startTime":284.32,"endTime":341.76,"words":[{"word":"So","start":284.64,"end":284.88},{"word":"spoke","start":284.88,"end":285.28},{"word":"my","start":285.28,"end":285.64},{"word":"Lady,","start":285.64,"end":286.48},{"word":"but","start":286.48,"end":286.68},{"word":"her","start":286.68,"end":286.84},{"word":"sight","start":286.84,"end":287.12},{"word":"did","start":287.12,"end":287.4},{"word":"not","start":287.4,"end":287.6},{"word":"move","start":287.6,"end":287.92},{"word":"from","start":287.92,"end":288.12},{"word":"attentive","start":288.12,"end":288.64},{"word":"watching","start":288.64,"end":289.4},{"word":"before","start":289.4,"end":289.76},{"word":"or","start":289.76,"end":290.08},{"word":"after","start":290.08,"end":290.4},{"word":"these","start":290.4,"end":290.64},{"word":"words.","start":290.64,"end":291.84},{"word":"Like","start":291.84,"end":292},{"word":"someone","start":292,"end":292.32},{"word":"who","start":292.32,"end":292.6},{"word":"strains","start":292.6,"end":293.04},{"word":"to","start":293.04,"end":293.16},{"word":"glimpse","start":293.16,"end":293.52},{"word":"the","start":293.52,"end":293.68},{"word":"sun's","start":293.68,"end":294},{"word":"eclipse","start":294,"end":294.44},{"word":"a","start":294.44,"end":294.6},{"word":"little,","start":294.6,"end":295.2},{"word":"and","start":295.2,"end":295.36},{"word":"by","start":295.36,"end":295.52},{"word":"looking","start":295.52,"end":295.92},{"word":"becomes","start":295.92,"end":296.32},{"word":"blind,","start":296.32,"end":297.36},{"word":"so","start":297.36,"end":29